INT. ST. CASIMIR CHURCH BASEMENT - BINGO NIGHT

Long tables, paper plates, a ball cage in the corner. Four people at a table near the stage, daubers beside their cards.

LORETTA BEAUCHAMP, 70s, ELIJAH STONE, 40s, PHILOMENA OKPARA, 60s, and DENNIS HALVERSEN, 50s, sit with their cards between them.

LORETTA
You moved my dauber.

ELIJAH
I did not.

LORETTA
It was by the napkin. Now it's by your elbow.

ELIJAH
Because you put it in my lane.

PHILOMENA
There are no lanes.

DENNIS
There are lanes.

PHILOMENA
Dennis, it's bingo.

DENNIS
It's bingo with lanes.

ELIJAH
I won't be shamed over a dauber.

LORETTA
No one is shaming. I'm observing.

PHILOMENA
You are doing the thing you do.

LORETTA
What thing?

PHILOMENA
The thing where you pretend you're not angry and you are.

LORETTA
I am not angry.

DENNIS
Your hand is shaking.

LORETTA
It's a cold basement.

ELIJAH
It's seventy-two degrees.

LORETTA
It's a cold basement in my heart.

PHILOMENA
Oh, for the love of God.

ELIJAH
Loretta, what is this about?

LORETTA
It's not about the dauber.

DENNIS
We know.

LORETTA
It's about Tuesday.

ELIJAH
What happened Tuesday?

LORETTA
You know what happened.

ELIJAH
I truly don't.

PHILOMENA
He truly doesn't.

LORETTA
You told Father Anselm I'd been spreading rumors.

ELIJAH
I said you'd been mentioning things.

LORETTA
"Mentioning."

ELIJAH
That's a gentler word than "spreading."

LORETTA
It's a word with a knife in it.

PHILOMENA
Loretta. Did you tell people about the roof fund?

LORETTA
I did not tell people. I told a few people.

DENNIS
How many is a few?

LORETTA
Eleven.

ELIJAH
Eleven.

LORETTA
It's a church. Eleven is a small number.

PHILOMENA
It's a congregation of forty.

LORETTA
Well. They were the right eleven.

DENNIS
And what did you say?

LORETTA
That the roof fund had four thousand dollars less than the books said.

ELIJAH
It had four thousand dollars less than the books said because of the boiler.

LORETTA
The boiler was a separate line item.

ELIJAH
It was not.

LORETTA
It's right there in the ledger.

ELIJAH
Whose ledger?

LORETTA
Yours.

PHILOMENA
Elijah. Is it in your ledger?

ELIJAH
(after a long pause)
There was a clerical error.

DENNIS
Ah.

LORETTA
A clerical error.

ELIJAH
Which I was going to correct.

LORETTA
When?

ELIJAH
After the Christmas pageant.

PHILOMENA
That's ten months.

ELIJAH
I've been very busy.

LORETTA
You were too busy to correct a clerical error but not too busy to tell Father Anselm I was mentioning.

ELIJAH
Loretta, I'm sorry.

LORETTA
Say it again.

ELIJAH
I'm sorry.

LORETTA
Once more with feeling.

ELIJAH
I'm sorry, Loretta. I was embarrassed. I panicked. It was a small panic.

LORETTA
It was a small panic with a large consequence.

DENNIS
He's apologized.

PHILOMENA
Twice.

LORETTA
(slowly)
Well.

ELIJAH
Well.

LORETTA
You may have your lane.

ELIJAH
Thank you.

PHILOMENA
Can we please play?

DENNIS
I'm in. Whoever calls the first number.

ELIJAH
B-nine.

LORETTA
Mine.

PHILOMENA
That was fast.

LORETTA
I've been waiting a long time.
